        JSON არის <b class="text-ink">ტექსტი</b>, რომელიც ობიექტს ჰგავს. სერვერიდან სტრიქონი მოდის —
        <code class="font-mono text-[13px]">response.json()</code> მას ნამდვილ JavaScript ობიექტად აქცევს.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1 font-mono text-[clamp(1rem,1.8vw,1.5rem)]">
        <button data-p="0" class="j-btn">resp_obj</button><span class="text-ink-2">.</span>
        <button data-p="1" class="j-btn">data</button><span class="text-ink-2">.</span>
        <button data-p="2" class="j-btn">products</button>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 min-h-[8rem] border-l-2 border-live pl-5">
        <p id="jTitle" class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-ink-2"></p>
        <p id="jDesc" class="mt-2 text-lg leading-snug"></p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-auto border border-rule bg-panel p-5 text-sm text-ink-2">
        ყოველი API სხვანაირად ფუთავს პასუხს. ზოგი პირდაპირ მასივს აბრუნებს, ზოგი — ობიექტში გახვეულს.
        <b class="text-ink">პირველი, რასაც აკეთებ ახალ API-სთან: <code class="font-mono text-[12px]">console.log</code> პასუხისა.</b>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-center">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-[#2d2d2d] bg-[#252526] px-5 py-2.5">
        <p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-[#969696]">response body — ის, რაც ქსელიდან მოვიდა</p>
      </div>
      <pre class="scroll overflow-auto bg-[#1e1e1e] p-6 font-mono text-[13px] leading-[1.65] text-[#d4d4d4]"><code><span data-j="0" class="j-line">{</span>
<span data-j="0" class="j-line">  <span class="text-[#9cdcfe]">"success"</span>: <span class="text-[#569cd6]">true</span>,</span>
<span data-j="1" class="j-line">  <span class="text-[#9cdcfe]">"data"</span>: {</span>
<span data-j="1" class="j-line">    <span class="text-[#9cdcfe]">"total"</span>: <span class="text-[#b5cea8]">124</span>,</span>
<span data-j="2" class="j-line">    <span class="text-[#9cdcfe]">"products"</span>: [</span>
<span data-j="2" class="j-line">      { <span class="text-[#9cdcfe]">"id"</span>: <span class="text-[#b5cea8]">1</span>, <span class="text-[#9cdcfe]">"name"</span>: <span class="text-[#ce9178]">"მარგარიტა"</span>, <span class="text-[#9cdcfe]">"price"</span>: <span class="text-[#b5cea8]">18.5</span>, <span class="text-[#9cdcfe]">"image"</span>: <span class="text-[#ce9178]">"https://…/margarita.jpg"</span> },</span>
<span data-j="2" class="j-line">      { <span class="text-[#9cdcfe]">"id"</span>: <span class="text-[#b5cea8]">2</span>, <span class="text-[#9cdcfe]">"name"</span>: <span class="text-[#ce9178]">"ლაზანია"</span>, <span class="text-[#9cdcfe]">"price"</span>: <span class="text-[#b5cea8]">24</span> }</span>
<span data-j="2" class="j-line">    ]</span>
<span data-j="1" class="j-line">  }</span>
<span data-j="0" class="j-line">}</span></code></pre>

      <div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-3 gap-px bg-rule">
